# shell: desktop
# mkdir: work/sub/quite-a-long-directory-name-that-will-not-fit-in-the-row
# file: work/sub/quite-a-long-directory-name-that-will-not-fit-in-the-row/deep.txt hi
# AW-073: a truncated Info field reveals its full text in a floating
# pop-up while hovered, and the pop-up leaves with the pointer.
wait 10
click 90 118
wait 2
click 90 118
wait 6
click-row 0
wait 2
click-row 0
wait 6
click-row 0
wait 2
key i ctrl
wait 10
note the Location is longer than its row; resting on it floats the whole
move 300 260
move 300 267
wait 12
expect-pixel 600 258 ffffc8
note and the pop-up leaves with the pointer
move 300 400
wait 4
expect-pixel 600 258 336698
quit
